quiz.prose:
Two trade logs, each sorted by time, are merged recursively.

```python
def merge(a, b):
    if not a:
        return b
    if not b:
        return a
    if a[0] <= b[0]:
        return [a[0]] + merge(a[1:], b)
    return [b[0]] + merge(a, b[1:])
```
